      "description": "A bald, pale-skinned man with sharp facial features, red eyes, and a menacing expression, wearing dark clothing. He is the central figure in the image, shown in a close-up with his mouth open as if screaming or shouting, conveying intense anger or rage. This is the character from the Harry Potter series, portrayed by actor Ralph Fiennes.",
