      "instance_name": "Harry_Potter_universe",
      "label": "Harry Potter universe",
      "description": "The meme references the fictional world of Harry Potter, where Hogwarts is a magical school and 'black magic' is a specific type of dark, forbidden magic. Understanding that this is a fictional setting is essential to comprehend the humor, as expulsion for using black magic is not a real-world consequence.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
