      "instance_name": "Ralph_Fiennes",
      "label": "Ralph Fiennes",
      "description": "Ralph Fiennes is the real-world actor who portrays Lord Voldemort in the Harry Potter film series. While his name is not visible in the image, recognizing him as the actor helps contextualize the image as a film still, which is important for understanding the source material and the meme's visual reference.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
