      "instance_name": "rage",
      "label": "intense anger expression",
      "description": "Lord Voldemort's face is contorted in a scream, with bared teeth, wide eyes, and a tense jaw, conveying extreme rage and fury. His open mouth and aggressive posture suggest he is shouting or yelling in anger.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
